Every clinician may consider a tricyclic-antidepressant for a neuropathic-pain.
Every clinician may consider a tetracyclic-antidepressant for a neuropathic-pain.
Every clinician may consider an SNRI-antidepressant for a neuropathic-pain.
Every clinician may consider a selected-anticonvulsant for a neuropathic-pain.
Every clinician may consider a capsaicin-patch for a neuropathic-pain.
Every clinician may consider a lidocaine-patch for a neuropathic-pain.
A selected-anticonvulsant-example includes a pregabalin-example and includes a gabapentin-enacarbil-example and includes an oxcarbazepine-example.
